{%- liquid
  assign contact_email = settings.contact_email | default: 'standerdmail@gmail.com'
-%}

{%- case handle -%}
  {%- when 'privacy-policy' -%}
    <p>Standard respects your privacy. This policy explains what information we collect when you visit the store or place an order, how we use it, and the choices you have.</p>

    <h2>Information we collect</h2>
    <p>When you browse the store, we receive technical information such as your browser type, device, and pages viewed. When you place an order or contact us, we collect the details you provide, including your name, email address, shipping address, and order information. Payment details are processed by our payment provider. We do not store your full card number.</p>

    <h2>How we use information</h2>
    <p>We use this information to fulfill orders, provide delivery updates, answer support requests, and keep the store secure. We may also use it to understand which pages are useful so we can improve the shopping experience. We do not sell your personal information.</p>

    <h2>Sharing</h2>
    <p>We share information only with the services required to run the store, such as payment processing, shipping, and email delivery. Those providers may use the information only to perform that work. We may also disclose information if the law requires it.</p>

    <h2>Cookies</h2>
    <p>The store uses cookies to keep your cart, remember preferences, and understand how the site is used. You can control cookies in your browser. Blocking some cookies may affect checkout.</p>

    <h2>Your choices</h2>
    <p>You may ask us what personal information we hold about you, request a correction, or ask us to delete it where we are not required to keep it for legal or accounting reasons. Email <a href="mailto:{{ contact_email }}">{{ contact_email }}</a> and we will respond as soon as we can.</p>

  {%- when 'refund-policy' -%}
    <p>You may return an unused item within 14 days of delivery for a refund. This 14-day period is the only return window we offer.</p>

    <h2>What you can return</h2>
    <p>The item should be unused, in its original condition, and include the packaging and accessories it arrived with. Items that have been used, damaged after delivery, or altered are not eligible. If a product arrives damaged or incorrect, email us and we will replace it or refund it.</p>

    <h2>How to start a return</h2>
    <p>Email <a href="mailto:{{ contact_email }}">{{ contact_email }}</a> with your order number and the reason for the return. Our support team is available 24/7 and will reply with the next step. Please wait for that reply before sending an item back.</p>

    <h2>Refunds</h2>
    <p>After we receive and inspect the return, we refund the item price to the original payment method. Shipping charges are refunded only when we made an error or the item was faulty. Please allow a short time for your bank or card provider to show the refund after we issue it.</p>

  {%- when 'shipping-policy' -%}
    <p>Orders are delivered in 3–5 days. That is the only delivery timeframe we quote.</p>

    <h2>Delivery</h2>
    <p>Once your order is placed, it is sent so that it arrives within 3–5 days. You will receive a confirmation email when the order is placed and a tracking link when it is on the way. Delivery times can vary slightly by destination, but the customer-facing estimate remains 3–5 days.</p>

    <h2>Shipping cost</h2>
    <p>Any shipping cost is shown at checkout before you pay. If a promotion offers free shipping, that is also confirmed on the checkout page.</p>

    <h2>Address and customs</h2>
    <p>Please check that your shipping address is complete before you place the order. If a destination charges import duty or local tax, that charge is set by the local authority and is the recipient’s responsibility when it applies.</p>

    <h2>Questions</h2>
    <p>For a shipping question, email <a href="mailto:{{ contact_email }}">{{ contact_email }}</a>. Our support team is available 24/7.</p>

  {%- when 'terms-of-service' -%}
    <p>These terms apply when you browse Standard or place an order. By using the store, you agree to them.</p>

    <h2>Orders</h2>
    <p>When you place an order, you offer to buy the items in your cart. We confirm the order by email. We may decline or cancel an order if an item is unavailable, if we suspect an error in the price, or if we cannot complete the payment. If we cancel an order you have already paid for, we refund the amount paid.</p>

    <h2>Prices and payment</h2>
    <p>Prices are shown in the store currency and are confirmed at checkout. Shipping costs, when they apply, are shown before you pay. You agree to provide current and accurate billing and shipping details.</p>

    <h2>Shipping and returns</h2>
    <p>Delivery is 3–5 days, as described in our shipping policy. Unused items may be returned within 14 days of delivery, as described in our refund policy. Those two timeframes are the ones that apply to every order.</p>

    <h2>Use of the store</h2>
    <p>You may use the store for personal shopping. You may not misuse the site, attempt to disrupt it, or use it to break the law. Product colors and details can vary slightly from photographs.</p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>Questions about these terms can be sent to <a href="mailto:{{ contact_email }}">{{ contact_email }}</a>.</p>

  {%- when 'contact-information' -%}
    <p>The best way to reach Standard is by email. Write to <a href="mailto:{{ contact_email }}">{{ contact_email }}</a>. Our support team is available 24/7 and will get back to you as soon as possible.</p>
    <p>Please include your order number if you are writing about a purchase. That helps us find the order quickly.</p>

  {%- else -%}
    <p>Questions about this policy can be sent to <a href="mailto:{{ contact_email }}">{{ contact_email }}</a>. Our support team is available 24/7 and will get back to you as soon as possible.</p>
    <p>Orders are delivered in 3–5 days. Unused items may be returned within 14 days of delivery.</p>
{%- endcase -%}
